!!! Calls extensions declared in a book other than the one that declares the
!!! types, which is the arrangement a one-type-per-file project produces.
book tour.shape.app

read everything from tour.shape
read everything from tour.shape.util

!!! A local record whose short name collides with nothing, to confirm the
!!! declaring book still wins for a type declared right here.
tile begin record
    field side as number
end record

tile begin extension
    area returns number begin paragraph
        give my side times my side
    end paragraph
end extension

main returns number begin paragraph
    value box is build rectangle with width being 8, height being 5
    value slim is build rectangle with width being 3, height being 5
    say box.area with nothing
    say box.wider-than with other being slim
    say slim.wider-than with other being box

    value panel is build surface with label being "titlebar", scale being 2
    say panel.describe with nothing
    say panel.scaled with factor being 7

    value square is build tile with side being 7
    say square.area with nothing
    give 0
end paragraph
